That's about the strategy I'd stumbled on myself.  I hit a level
with a number of giants, so I'd kill one, eat it, go back up,
zap a few spells (very good for getting well below satiated
quickly), then go back down.  Leaving the pet rock troll
upstairs so he didn't get a chance to eat them.

Just that one level has pushed me up to 18/66.

